2026-09-15 04:06:35,582 [INFO]       >= 2x the leg's OPENING OI, peak < 30 min old, OI now 30% below it within
2026-09-15 04:06:35,583 [INFO]       20 min of the peak, price above the price at the OI peak, spot through the
2026-09-15 04:06:35,583 [INFO]       strike. Does NOT chase: rests a limit at (close at the OI-peak minute)
2026-09-15 04:06:35,583 [INFO]       x 1.10 for 20 min. Exit: no stop, trail arms at 3x, 40% giveback, 15:25.
