2026-09-15 04:06:35,583 [INFO] 
2026-09-15 04:06:35,583 [INFO]     LSC "last seller climax" -- buys the ONE bar where the last seller sold the
2026-09-15 04:06:35,583 [INFO]       low. Same bar: volume >= 4x the leg's 30-bar median, OI HIGHER than the
2026-09-15 04:06:35,583 [INFO]       previous bar (fresh writing, not covering), lowest close of 30 bars,
2026-09-15 04:06:35,583 [INFO]       premium Rs15-40. Then within 15 min: price closes back above that low AND
2026-09-15 04:06:35,583 [INFO]       that bar's OI starts leaving. Market entry -- no pullback ever comes on
2026-09-15 04:06:35,583 [INFO]       this shape (measured: a 0.80x limit is never filled). Exit as WCR, 15:28.
2026-09-15 04:06:35,583 [INFO]       TARGET MOVE 2026-08-18 24250PE 25.00 -> 102.35 (Rs+5,028 available):
